  "question": {
    "text": "A scooter accelerates from rest for time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> at constant rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and then retards at constant rate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> for time&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> and comes to rest. The correct value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math> will be :",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "hjHDG",
      "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math></p>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "KZEDp",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lYdxD",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "8Zz6m",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac></math>",
